Third-party content
-------------------

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository. Runtime
dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml and installed from PyPI; their
licences are their own:

  typer      MIT
  click      BSD-3-Clause
  boto3      Apache-2.0
  rich       MIT
  PyYAML     MIT

The Lambda deployment package built by `clamper deploy` contains this
package, minus its command line, demo and deploy code, and the pure-Python
modules of PyYAML (MIT), whose licence file is included in the package as
yaml/LICENSE. PyYAML's compiled extension is not included. `boto3` and
`botocore` are already present in the Lambda Python runtime, and `typer`,
`click` and `rich` are command-line-only and deliberately excluded. See
src/clamper/deploy.py.

