AWS
---

Clamper drives Amazon Web Services' Budgets, EC2, EC2 Auto Scaling, ECS, RDS,
Lambda, SageMaker, SNS, DynamoDB, EventBridge and CloudFormation APIs. Jet1
is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Amazon Web Services.
"AWS", "Amazon Web Services" and the names of the services above are
trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.

The AWS behaviour Clamper depends on — the Budgets refresh cadence, the
once-per-period `ACTUAL` alert, and RDS restarting a stopped instance after
seven days — is documented with links in docs/design.md. It was read from
AWS's own documentation rather than recalled, because all three decide what
the tool can honestly promise.

